  "editorial": "Maintain four boundaries and the next integer. Fill the top edge left-to-right, the right edge downward, the bottom edge right-to-left if present, and the left edge upward if present. Shrink boundaries as edges are consumed. Each cell is assigned once. The independent oracle follows a direction vector, turning whenever the next position is outside the board or already filled.",
